{
 "key": "dpdp-compliance",
 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "label": "What is the DPDP Act?",
   "texts": [
    {
     "key": "s1.1",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "What is the DPDP Act?"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.2",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "The"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.3",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "DPDP Act, 2023"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.4",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "is India's primary framework for regulating the processing of digital personal data."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.5",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "It establishes requirements relating to:"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.6",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Personal data processing"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.7",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Consent and lawful processing"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.8",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Data Principal rights"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.9",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Data security"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.10",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Breach management"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.11",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Grievance redressal"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.12",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Children's data"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.13",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Significant Data Fiduciaries"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.14",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Regulatory oversight"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.15",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "The"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.16",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.17",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "provide detailed operational requirements under the framework."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.18",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Who Needs to Consider DPDP?"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.19",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "DPDP requirements can apply to organisations across industries that process digital personal data."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.20",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Manufacturing"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.21",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Customer, employee, dealer, supplier and enquiry data."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.22",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Real Estate"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.23",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Buyer, tenant, lead, broker and customer information."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.24",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "IT & SaaS"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.25",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "User, customer, support, application and marketing data."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.26",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Hotels & Hospitality"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.27",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Guest, booking, contact, loyalty and marketing information."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.28",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Healthcare"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.29",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Patient, appointment, employee and related personal data."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.30",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Education"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.31",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Student, parent/guardian, admission and academic information."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.32",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Banking & Financial Services"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.33",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Customer, KYC, employee and financial-service related data."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.34",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Retail & E-Commerce"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.35",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Customer accounts, orders, delivery, support and marketing information."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.36",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Every organisation should assess its own processing activities and applicable requirements."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.37",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Key Areas of DPDP Compliance"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.38",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Data Discovery & Inventory"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.39",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Identify personal data, systems, applications, processing activities and data flows across the organisation."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.40",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Purpose & Lawful Basis"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.41",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Map each processing activity to its purpose and applicable lawful basis."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.42",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Privacy Notices"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.43",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Provide clear information about personal data collection, processing purposes and applicable rights."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.44",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Consent Management"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.45",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Where consent is the applicable basis, manage consent, preferences, evidence and withdrawal throughout the lifecycle."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.46",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Data Principal Rights"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.47",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Enable applicable requests such as access, correction, erasure, consent withdrawal and grievance redressal."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.48",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Data Security"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.49",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Implement appropriate technical and organisational safeguards including access control, encryption, logging, monitoring and secure disposal."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.50",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Breach Management"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.51",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Establish processes to detect, assess, respond to and document personal-data breaches."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.52",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Retention & Erasure"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.53",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Define appropriate retention periods and implement controlled review, deletion and disposal processes."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.54",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Processor & Vendor Governance"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.55",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Identify third parties processing personal data and manage their contracts, data access, security and compliance responsibilities."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.56",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "DPIA & Privacy Risk"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.57",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Assess privacy risks associated with applicable processing activities and implement appropriate controls."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.58",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Children & Guardian Data"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.59",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Implement appropriate controls for processing children's personal data and applicable guardian-related requirements."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.60",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Governance & Audit"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.61",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Maintain policies, responsibilities, assessments, audit trails, evidence, findings and remediation activities."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.62",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "DPDPA Technology Consulting"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.63",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Turning Privacy Requirements into Technology & Business Controls"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.64",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "We provide"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.65",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "DPDPA Technology Consulting"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.66",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "to help organisations translate India's"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.67",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDP Act)"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.68",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "requirements into practical technology, processes and governance controls."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.69",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Our consulting approach covers the complete personal data lifecycle:"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.70",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Collection → Consent → Processing → Storage → Sharing → Retention → Deletion"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.71",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "with a focus on improving"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.72",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "privacy, security and regulatory readiness"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.73",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Our Key Consulting Areas"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.74",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "DPDPA Readiness Assessment"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.75",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Assess your current technology, processes and controls to identify compliance gaps and priorities."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.76",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Personal Data Discovery & Mapping"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.77",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Discover, classify and map personal data across applications, databases, business processes and data flows."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.78",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Consent & Preference Management"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.79",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Design and implement consent, preference and withdrawal workflows where applicable."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.80",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Data Principal Rights"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.81",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Enable technology-driven workflows for applicable access, correction, erasure and other rights requests."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.82",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Privacy Notice & Consent Workflows"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.83",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Integrate privacy notices and applicable consent mechanisms into websites, applications and business processes."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.84",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Retention & Deletion Automation"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.85",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Define retention policies and automate applicable review, deletion and disposal processes."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.86",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Data Breach & Incident Management"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.87",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Design workflows for incident detection, assessment, escalation, response, notification and evidence management."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.88",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Vendor & Third-Party Governance"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.89",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Assess and manage third-party processors, data sharing, contractual controls and data flows."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.90",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Privacy-by-Design Assessment"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.91",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Evaluate applications and new initiatives for privacy requirements before implementation or release."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.92",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Audit Trails & Compliance Reporting"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.93",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Establish evidence, audit trails, compliance dashboards, assessments and management reporting."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.94",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Enterprise Application Integration"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.95",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Integrate DPDP controls with ERP, CRM, HRMS, websites, mobile applications, APIs and other business systems."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.96",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Privacy Technology Roadmap"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.97",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Develop a practical roadmap for implementing and continuously improving privacy technology and controls."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.98",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Our DPDP Implementation Approach"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.99",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "We help organisations move from"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.100",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "compliance requirements to an operational privacy framework"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.101",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Assess"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.102",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Understand your organisation, personal data, systems, processes and current compliance posture."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.103",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Design"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.104",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Define the appropriate privacy processes, technology controls, governance structure and implementation roadmap."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.105",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Implement"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.106",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Implement notices, consent, rights, retention, security, processor, incident and governance controls."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.107",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Integrate"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.108",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Connect privacy controls with your existing business applications and technology ecosystem."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.109",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Monitor"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.110",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Continuously track compliance activities, risks, requests, incidents, vendors and remediation."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.111",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Demonstrate"
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.112",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Maintain evidence, audit trails, reports and compliance records to demonstrate your privacy posture."
    },
    {
     "key": "s1.113",
     "kind": "text",
     "value": "Sentinel-DPDP"
    },
    {
